Package: tailbond
Version: @VERSION@
Depends: kmod-tun, ip-full, jshn, jsonfilter
Source: https://github.com/mp0rta/mqvpn (data plane), tailbond (agent)
License: Apache-2.0
Section: net
Architecture: @ARCH@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Maintainer: Tiger Kaovilai <passawit.kaovilai@gmail.com>
Description: Speedify-style WAN bonding to your own home server.
 Bonds every WAN (ethernet, repeater Wi-Fi, USB tethering, cellular) into one
 Multipath QUIC tunnel (mqvpn, static) to a tailbond server, with the tailnet
 reachable through it. Agent and web UI (tailbondd) on port 8077.
